              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h2>Jewelry Made to Last. Care You Can Trust.</h2><p>Jewelry is more than something you wear. It can mark a milestone, carry a memory, or become part of your everyday style. That's why we believe every piece deserves thoughtful care.</p><p>From jewelry repairs and resizing to cleaning, engraving, and restoration, our skilled team is here to help keep your favorite pieces looking beautiful and wearing well.</p><h3>What We Offer</h3><ul><li>Professional jewelry repairs</li><li>Ring sizing and adjustments</li><li>Jewelry cleaning and polishing</li><li>Stone setting and replacement</li><li>Engraving and personalization</li><li>Custom jewelry services</li><li>Watch repair and maintenance</li><li>Eyewear repair</li></ul><h3>Quality in Every Detail</h3><p>We take pride in careful workmanship, quality materials, and attention to detail. Whether you're purchasing a new piece or bringing in something you've treasured for years, we treat every item with the care it deserves.</p><p><strong>Have a piece that needs some attention? We'd love to help.</strong></p>",
